# Local scratch and virtualenvs. `.venv*/` rather than `.venv/` because the
# skillspector work creates `.venv-skillspector/`, which is 15k files.
tmp/
.venv*/

# The Scuba control plane. It is mirrored to its own `scuba-state/...` branch,
# deliberately, so that plans and records stay visible without entering `main`'s
# history. Committing it here would fork the mirror.
.scuba/

# The skillgate block that stood here through 0.5.0 — `go.work`, `go.work.sum`,
# `skillgate/`, `skills/skill-gate/` — is gone because 0.6.0 ships that program.
# It is named here rather than deleted silently: the entries were what stopped a
# `git add -A` from staging the 0.6.0 work beside the 0.5.0 release, so their
# absence is the release, and a reader who finds skillgate files tracked should
# find the reason where the refusal used to be.
#
# What is out of scope for 0.6.0 is out of scope for a different reason and is
# held in a different place. `docs/research/` belongs to 0.7.0 and is refused at
# the index by tests/lib/out-of-scope-check.sh, not here — a research note is
# meant to be visible to its author while it is being written, which is the
# opposite of what an ignore entry does.
